  equipmentNote: 'Belt loader: the conveyor that runs bags up to a hold door. Around
    three and a half tonnes, and geared for the apron rather than the road, so it
    tops out near 25 km/h. It carries no hitch, because a loader is driven to the
    aircraft and never tows a train.'
